<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu eri Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bef</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu eri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abaefeso</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Nze Pawulo, omutume wa Kristo Yesu, olw’okwagala kwa Katonda, mpandiikira abatukuvu abali mu Efeso, era abakkiririza mu Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Ekisa n’emirembe ebiva eri Katonda Kitaffe ne Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo bibeerenga nammwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Emikisa mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Yeebazibwe Katonda era Kitaawe wa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, atuwadde mu Kristo buli mukisa gwonna ogw’omwoyo oguva mu ggulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Yatulonda okubeera mu Kristo ng’ensi tennatondebwa, ffe tube batukuvu, abataliiko kya kunenyezebwa mu maaso ge, olw’okwagala kwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Olw’okwagala kwe, yatuteekateeka tubeere abaana be mu Yesu Kristo, ng’okusiima kwe bwe kuli. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Katonda tumutendereze olw’ekisa kye yatuwa obuwa mu Mwana, gw’ayagala ennyo. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Mu oyo mwe tununulibwa olw’omusaayi gwe, ne tusonyiyibwa ebibi, ng’obugagga bw’ekisa kye bwe buli, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>kye yatuwa mu bungi mu magezi gonna ne mu kutegeera kwonna. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Yatubikkulira ekyama eky’okwagala kwe, ng’okusiima kwe bwe kuli kwe yateekerateekera mu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Olwo ekiseera ekituufu bwe kirituuka, Katonda alikola byonna bye yateekateeka, n’ateeka ebintu byonna awamu wansi wa Kristo, ebiri mu ggulu n’ebiri ku nsi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Era mu ye mwe twaweerwa obusika ne twawulibwa ng’enteekateeka bw’eri ey’oyo akola ebintu byonna okusinziira ku magezi ag’okwagala kwe; <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>ffe Abayudaaya tulyoke tumuleetere okugulumizibwa, ffe abaasooka okuba n’essuubi mu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Nammwe, Kristo yabaleeta eri amazima, kye kigambo eky’Enjiri ey’okulokolebwa kwammwe. Bwe mwamukkiriza, ne muteekebwako envumbo eya Mwoyo Mutukuvu eyasuubizibwa, <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>gwe musingo gw’obusika bwaffe, okutuusa bw’alinunula abantu be, ne Katonda n’agulumizibwa era n’atenderezebwa.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okusaba kwa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Noolwekyo okuva lwe nawulira okukkiriza kwe mulina mu Mukama waffe Yesu, n’okwagala kwe mulina eri abantu ba Katonda bonna, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>sirekangayo kwebaza Katonda ku lwammwe. Mbajjukira <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>ne mbasabira, Katonda wa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, Kitaffe ow’ekitiibwa, abawe Omwoyo ow’amagezi n’okubikkulirwa mweyongere okumutegeera. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Nnyongera okubasabira, amaaso g’emitima gyammwe gamulisibwenga, mulyoke mumanye essuubi ly’okuyitibwa kwammwe, n’obugagga obungi bwe mulina mu ye, mmwe awamu n’abantu ba Katonda bonna. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Njagala mutegeere amaanyi ge agasukkiridde agakolera mu ffe abakkiriza, ng’okukola kw’obuyinza bw’amaanyi ge bwe kuli, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>amaanyi ago ge yakozesa mu Kristo bwe yamuzuukiza mu bafu, n’amutuuza ku mukono gwe ogwa ddyo waggulu mu ggulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Waggulu eyo, Kristo gy’afugira obufuzi bwonna, n’obuyinza bwonna, n’amaanyi gonna, n’obwami bwonna, na buli kitiibwa kyonna ekiweebwa omuntu. Afugira mu mulembe guno, era alifugira ne mu mulembe ogugenda okujja. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Katonda atadde ebintu byonna wansi w’ebigere bye, n’afuula Kristo omutwe gw’ebintu byonna eby’ekkanisa, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>era ekkanisa gwe mubiri gwe ye yennyini, mwatuukiririza ebintu byonna.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuggyibwa mu Kufa n’Okufuulibwa Abalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Edda mwali mufiiridde mu byonoono byammwe ne mu bibi byammwe. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Ebyo bye mwatambulirangamu ng’emirembe egy’ensi bwe giri, nga mufugibwa omwoyo ogw’omukulu w’obuyinza obw’omu bbanga, omwoyo ogwa Setaani, ogufuga abajeemu bonna. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Edda naffe twatambuliranga mu kwegomba kw’emibiri gyaffe, nga tukola ebyo ebyegombebwanga omubiri n’ebirowoozo. Era okufaanana ng’abantu abalala bonna, naffe mu buzaaliranwa twali baakubonerezebwa ng’abalala bonna. <verse eid="EPH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Kyokka olw’okwagala kwe okungi, n’ekisa kye ekingi, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>ne bwe twali nga tufiiridde mu bibi byaffe, yatufuula abalamu awamu ne Kristo. Mwalokolebwa lwa kisa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Katonda yatuzuukiriza wamu ne Kristo okuva mu kufa ne tufuna obulamu, era atutuuzizza mu bifo eby’omu ggulu, okumpi ne Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Ekyo Katonda yakikola alyoke alage, mu mirembe egigenda okujja, ekisa kye ekingi kye yatukwatirwa mu Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Mwalokolebwa lwa kisa olw’okukkiriza. Tekwava mu mmwe, wabula kirabo kya Katonda. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Tekwatuweebwa lwa bikolwa byaffe; noolwekyo omuntu yenna aleme okwenyumirizanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Tuli mulimu gwa Katonda, abaatondebwa mu Kristo Yesu, okukolanga ebikolwa ebirungi, nga Katonda bwe yatuteekerateekera.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Noolwekyo mujjukire, ng’edda mmwe abaali Abaamawanga mu mubiri, abaayitibwanga abatali bakomole abo abeeyita abaakomolebwa, kyokka nga baakomolebwa mu mubiri na ngalo z’abantu, <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>nga mu biro biri temwamanya Kristo. Temwabalirwa mu ggwanga lya Isirayiri, era ng’Abaamawanga, temwalina mugabo mu ndagaano ya Katonda ey’ekisuubizo. Mwali wala ne Katonda, nga n’essuubi temulina. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Naye kaakano mu Kristo Yesu, mmwe abaali ewala mwasembezebwa olw’omusaayi gwa Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kristo gy’emirembe gyaffe, oyo eyatufuula ffe Abayudaaya nammwe Abaamawanga, okuba omuntu omu, ng’amenyeewo ekisenge ekya wakati eky’obulabe, ekyatwawulanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Yadibya n’etteeka mu mateeka, alyoke yeetondemu omuntu omuggya ava mu babiri, ng’aleeta emirembe, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>alyoke atabaganye ababiri okufuuka omubiri gumu eri Katonda olw’omusaalaba, bwe yazikiririza obulabe ku gwo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Yajja okubuulira emirembe abo abaali ewala ne Katonda, n’abo abaali okumpi naye. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Ku bw’oyo Kristo ffenna tuyita mu Mwoyo omu okutuuka eri Kitaffe.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Noolwekyo temukyali baamawanga oba abagwira, wabula muli ba kika kimu n’abatukuvu, abantu ba Katonda, era muli ba mu nnyumba ya Katonda. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Mwazimbibwa ku musingi ogw’abatume ne bannabbi, nga Kristo Yesu ly’ejjinja ekkulu ery’oku nsonda. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Mu oyo ffenna tuzimbibwa wamu ne tugattibwa wamu ne tubeera essinzizo ettukuvu mu Mukama waffe. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Era nammwe mwazimbibwa wamu mu kizimbe ekyo Kristo ky’azimbye okubeeranga ekifo Omwoyo wa Katonda mwabeera.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulimu gwa Pawulo mu Baamawanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Nze Pawulo, Kristo Yesu yanfuula omusibe we, nsobole okuyamba mmwe Abaamawanga.<verse eid="EPH 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Mwawulira ekisa kya Katonda kye naweebwa okubayamba. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Nga bwe nasooka okubawandiikira mu bimpimpi, Katonda alina okubikkulirwa okw’ekyama kwe yandaga. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Bwe munaasoma ebbaluwa eno mujja kusobola okutegeera ebyo bye mmanyi ku kyama kya Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Mu biro eby’edda, tewali yali amanyi kyama ekyo okutuusa Omwoyo wa Katonda bw’akibikkulidde abatume be abatukuvu ne bannabbi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Kino kye kyama kye njogerako: olw’enjiri ya Kristo, Abaamawanga balisikira wamu ne Isirayiri ekyo Katonda kye yasuubiza, era baliba omubiri gumu, era ne bagabanira wamu ekisuubizo ekyo mu Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Nafuuka omuweereza w’enjiri eyo olw’ekirabo eky’ekisa kya Katonda kye naweebwa, Katonda ng’akolera mu maanyi ge. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Newaakubadde nga nze nsembayo wansi mu batukuvu bonna, naweebwa ekisa ekyo, okubuulira Abaamawanga emikisa egiri mu Kristo egitageraageraganyizika. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Katonda eyatonda ebintu byonna yayagala nnyambe buli muntu okutegeera ebyekyama ebyali bikwekeddwa mu Katonda. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Katonda yakigenderera atyo, ng’ayita mu kkanisa, alyoke yeeyoleke eri amaanyi n’obuyinza ebiri mu nsi ey’omwoyo eya waggulu, ng’abalaga nga bw’alina amagezi amangi ag’ebika eby’enjawulo. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Katonda yakola bw’atyo ng’enteekateeka ye ey’emirembe n’emirembe bw’eri, gye yatuukiriza mu ebyo byonna Kristo Yesu Mukama waffe bye yakola. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Kristo atuwa obuvumu n’obugumu, tulyoke tusembere mu maaso ga Katonda olw’okukkiriza nga tetutya. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Kyenva mbeegayirira muleme kuterebuka olw’okubonaabona kwange ku lwammwe, kubanga ekyo kibaleetera kitiibwa.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwagala kwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Nfukaamirira Kitaffe, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>ebika byonna eby’omu ggulu n’eby’oku nsi mwe biggya obulamu. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Nsaba Katonda oyo akola eby’ekitalo era agulumizibwa, agumyenga era anywezenga omuntu wammwe ow’omunda, olw’Omwoyo we, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Kristo alyoke abeerenga mu mitima gyammwe olw’okukkiriza kwammwe. Mbasabira mubeerenga n’emirandira mu kwagala nga mukunywereddemu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>mulyoke mubeerenga n’amaanyi awamu n’abatukuvu bonna, okusobola okutegeera obugazi, n’obuwanvu, n’obugulumivu n’okukka wansi ebiri mu kwagala kwa Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Njagala mutegeere okwagala kwa Kristo okusukkiridde okutegeera kwonna, mulyoke musobole okutegeerera ddala Katonda bw’ali.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Kaakano nsaba nti oyo akola ebintu byonna okusinga byonna bye tusaba, ne bye tulowooza, ng’amaanyi ge bwe gali agakolera mu ffe, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>agulumizibwenga mu Kkanisa ne mu Kristo Yesu, emirembe n’emirembe. Amiina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuba ab’Omubiri Ogumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Ng’omusibe wa Mukama waffe, mbakuutira mubeere n’empisa ezisaanira obulamu bwe mwayitirwa okutambuliramu. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Mubeerenga bakkakkamu, abawombeefu era abagumiikiriza, nga mugumiikirizagana mu kwagala. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Munyiikirenga okukuuma obumu obw’Omwoyo mu kwegatta awamu okw’emirembe. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Omubiri nga bwe guli ogumu, n’Omwoyo omu, n’essuubi liri limu ery’okuyitibwa kwammwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Mukama waffe ali omu, n’okukkiriza kumu n’okubatizibwa kumu. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Katonda ali omu, era ye Kitaawe wa bonna, afuga byonna, akolera mu byonna era abeera mu byonna.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Buli omu ku ffe yaweebwa ekisa ng’okugera kwa Kristo bwe kuli. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ebyawandiikibwa kyebiva bigamba nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Bwe yalinnya mu ggulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">n’atwala omunyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">n’awa abantu ebirabo.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Okugamba nti “yalinnya,” kitegeeza ki? Kitegeeza nti yasooka kukka mu bitundu ebya wansi w’ensi. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Oyo Kristo eyakka, ye wuuyo ddala eyalinnya ewala ennyo, n’ayisa waggulu w’eggulu lyonna, alyoke ajjule obwengula bw’ensi yonna. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Era y’omu oyo eyawa abamu okuba abatume, n’abalala okuba bannabbi, n’abalala okuba ababuulizi b’enjiri, n’abalala okuba abasumba, n’abalala okuba abayigiriza. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ekyo yakikola olw’okutendeka abantu ba Katonda olw’omulimu ogw’obuweereza, okuzimba omubiri gwa Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Ekyo kijja kutwongera okugenda mu maaso, okutuusa ffenna lwe tulibeera n’okukkiriza kumu, n’okumanyira ddala Omwana wa Katonda nga tukulidde ddala mu mwoyo okutuuka ku kigera eky’okubeera nga Kristo bw’ali.<verse eid="EPH 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Tuteekwa okulekeraawo okweyisa ng’abaana abato, nga tuyuuguumizibwa amayengo nga tutwalibwa buli muyaga ogw’okuyigiriza okw’abantu abakuusa, mu nkwe olw’okugoberera enteekateeka ey’obulimba. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Tube ba mazima mu kwagala, tulyoke tukulire mu Kristo mu byonna, nga tweyongera okuba nga ye, Omutwe gw’Ekkanisa. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Mu ye omubiri gwonna mwe gugattirwa obulungi awamu, ne guyungibwa mu buli nnyingo, nga gukola ng’ekigera kya buli kitundu bwe kuli, nga gukula era nga gwezimba mu kwagala.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulamu Obuggya mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Ng’omugoberezi wa Mukama waffe, mbalagira okulekeraawo okutambula ng’abatamanyi Katonda bwe batambulira mu birowoozo byabwe eby’obusirusiru. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Amagezi gaabwe gajjudde ekizikiza. Tebalina mugabo mu by’obulamu bwa Katonda, kubanga bajjudde obutamanya era emitima gyabwe mikakanyavu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Tebakyalina nsonyi, beemalidde mu bya buwemu, na mululu gwa kukola bya bugwenyufu ebya buli ngeri.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Kyokka mmwe si bwe mwayigirizibwa ku bya Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Obanga ddala mwamuwulira, era ne muyigirizibwa mu ye ng’amazima bwe gali mu Yesu, <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>kale mwambulemu obulamu obw’omuntu ow’edda, avunda olw’okwegomba okw’obulimba. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Mufuuke baggya olw’Omwoyo afuga ebirowoozo byammwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>era mwambale omuntu omuggya, eyatondebwa mu kifaananyi kya Katonda mu butuukirivu ne mu kutukuzibwa okw’amazima.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Mulekeraawo okulimba, mwogerenga amazima buli muntu ne munne, kubanga tuli bitundu bya mubiri gumu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>“Bwe musunguwalanga mwekuume muleme kwonoona.” Temuzibyanga budde nga mukyasunguwadde. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Temuwanga Setaani bbanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Abadde omubbi alekeraawo okubba, wabula anyiikirenga okukola eby’omugaso ng’akola n’emikono gye, alyoke afune ky’agabirako n’abo abeetaaga.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Mwekuume mulemenga okwogera ebigambo ebitasaana, wabula mwogerenga ebyo byokka ebizimba nga buli muntu bwe yeetaaga, biryoke bigase abo ababiwulira. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Era temunakuwazanga Mwoyo Mutukuvu wa Katonda, eyabateekako akabonero akalaga nga mwanunulibwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Okunyiiga, n’obusungu, n’obukambwe, n’okukaayana, n’okuvuma, na buli kibi kyonna, biremenga kubeera mu mmwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Mubenga ba kisa, buli omu alumirwenga munne, era musonyiwaganenga, nga Katonda bwe yabasonyiwa mu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Okubeera mu Musana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Mufubenga okufaanana Katonda kubanga muli baana ba Katonda abaagalwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mwagalanenga nga Kristo bwe yatwagala ne yeewaayo ku lwaffe n’afuuka ekiweebwayo era ssaddaaka eri Katonda, eyakawoowo akalungi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Nga bwe muli abantu ba Katonda abatukuvu, obwenzi, n’obugwagwa bwonna, n’omululu bireme okuwulirwa mu mmwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Mwewale okwogera eby’ensonyi, n’eby’obusirusiru, n’okubalaata ebitasaana. Mwebazenga bwebaza Katonda. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Mukimanye era mukitegeerere ddala nga buli mwenzi, oba omugwagwa, oba eyeegomba, aba asinza bakatonda abalala, talina mugabo mu bwakabaka bwa Kristo ne Katonda. <verse eid="EPH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Omuntu yenna tabalimbalimbanga n’ebigambo ebitaliimu. Katonda abonereza buli muntu yenna amujeemera. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Noolwekyo temwegattanga n’abafaanana ng’abo.<verse eid="EPH 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Edda mwali ng’abantu ab’ekizikiza, naye kaakano muli bantu ba musana mu Mukama waffe. Noolwekyo mutambulenga ng’abaana ab’omusana, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>ekitangaala kyammwe kirabisibwe. Mubale ebibala eby’omusana nga mweyisa bulungi, nga mubeera abeesimbu era ab’amazima, <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>nga munoonya ekyo ekisanyusa Mukama waffe. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Temwenyigiranga mu bikolwa bya kizikiza kubanga tebigasa, wabula munenyenga ababikola. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Kubanga kya nsonyi n’okubyogerako ebyo abajeemu bye bakolera mu kyama. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Byonna bwe biryatuukirizibwa mu kitangaala, birirabikira ddala nga bwe biri. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Ekitangaala kirabisa buli kintu. Kyekiva kigambibwa nti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Zuukuka ggwe eyeebase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Ozuukire mu bafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Kristo anaakwakira.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Mutunule nga mutambula n’obwegendereza, si ng’abatalina magezi wabula ng’abalina amagezi, <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>nga temwonoona biseera kubanga ennaku zino mbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Temubanga basirusiru, naye mutegeere Mukama waffe ky’ayagala. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Ate temutamiiranga, kubanga mujja kweyonoona, wabula Omwoyo ajjulenga mu bulamu bwammwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Bwe mukuŋŋananga muzimbaganenga mu Zabbuli ne mu nnyimba, ne mu nnyimba ez’Omwoyo nga muyimbira Mukama era nga mumuyimusiza amaloboozi mu mutima gwammwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Bulijjo mwebazenga Katonda Kitaffe olwa byonna, mu linnya lya Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakazi ne ba Bbaabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Mutyenga Kristo, nga muwuliragananga.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Abakazi, muwulirenga babbammwe nga bwe muwulira Mukama waffe. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Omusajja gwe mutwe gw’omukazi, nga Kristo bw’ali omutwe gw’Ekkanisa. Ekkanisa gwe mubiri gwa Kristo, era ye yennyini ye Mulokozi waagwo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Kale ng’Ekkanisa bw’ewulira Kristo, n’abakazi bwe batyo bwe basaana okuwuliranga ba bbaabwe mu byonna.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Nammwe abaami mwagalenga bakyala bammwe nga Kristo bwe yayagala Ekkanisa ne yeewaayo ku lwayo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Yaginaaza n’amazzi, n’agitukuza n’ekigambo kye, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>alyoke yeefunire Ekkanisa ey’ekitiibwa, eteriiko bbala wadde akamogo oba ekintu kyonna ekikyamu, wabula ebeere entukuvu, etuukiridde. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>N’abasajja bwe batyo bwe basaana okwagalanga bakazi baabwe, nga bwe baagala emibiri gyabwe gyennyini. Ayagala mukazi we yeeyagala yekka. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Tewali n’omu yali akyaye omubiri gwe, wabula aguliisa era agujjanjaba nga Kristo bw’ajjanjaba Ekkanisa ye, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>kubanga tuli bitundu bya mubiri gwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>“Kale omusajja kyanaavanga aleka kitaawe ne nnyina ne yeegatta ne mukazi we, ne bafuuka omuntu omu.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Ekyama kino kikulu, kyokka nze ndowooza nti kyogera ku Kristo n’Ekkanisa ye. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Kale, nammwe buli musajja ayagalenga mukazi we nga bwe yeeyagala yennyini, era n’omukazi assengamu bba ekitiibwa.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Abazadde n’Abaana Baabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Abaana, muwulirenga bazadde bammwe mu Mukama waffe, kubanga bwe mukola mutyo, mukola kituufu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Kitaawo ne nnyoko obassangamu ekitiibwa,” eryo lye tteeka erisooka eririmu okusuubiza nti: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>Bw’onoobanga obulungi, era n’owangaala ku nsi. <verse eid="EPH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Nammwe abazadde, temunyigirizanga baana bammwe, wabula mubakuze nga mubagunjula era nga mubayigiriza ebya Mukama waffe.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaddu ne Bakama Baabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Abaddu, muwulirenga bakama bammwe ab’omu mubiri nga mubatya era nga mubawa ekitiibwa ng’omutima gwammwe mumalirivu, nga bwe mwamalirira mu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Ekyo temukikola lwa kulabibwa, abantu balyoke babasiime, wabula mukolenga ng’abaddu ba Kristo nga mukola n’omutima gwammwe gwonna, nga Katonda bw’ayagala. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Muweerezenga n’omutima omulungi ng’abakolera Mukama waffe so si ng’abakolera abantu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>nga mumanyi ng’ekirungi kyonna omuntu ky’akola, oba muddu oba wa ddembe, Mukama alimusasula empeera ennungi. <verse eid="EPH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Era nammwe bakama b’abaddu, muyisenga bulungi abaddu bammwe nga temubatiisatiisa, nga mumanyi nti Mukama waabwe, ye Mukama wammwe, ali mu ggulu era ye tasosola mu bantu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyokulwanyisa bya Katonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Eky’enkomerero, mubenga n’amaanyi mu Mukama waffe ne mu buyinza obw’amaanyi ge. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Mwambale ebyokulwanyisa byonna ebya Katonda, mulyoke musobole okwolekera enkwe za Setaani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Kubanga tetumeggana na mubiri wadde musaayi, wabula tulwanyisa abafuzi, n’ab’obuyinza, n’amaanyi ag’ensi ag’ekizikiza, n’emyoyo emibi egy’omu bifo ebya waggulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Noolwekyo mwambalenga ebyokulwanyisa byonna ebya Katonda, mulyoke musobole okwaŋŋanga omulabe ku lunaku olw’akabi, era bwe mulimala okukola byonna, mulyoke musigale nga muli banywevu. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Muyimirire nga muli banywevu, ng’amazima lwe lukoba lwammwe lwe mwesibye mu kiwato kyammwe, ate ng’obutuukirivu kye ky’omu kifuba, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>nga mwambadde n’engatto mu bigere byammwe nga mugenda okubuulira Enjiri ey’emirembe. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Era ku ebyo byonna okukkiriza kwammwe kubeerenga engabo eneebasobozesanga okuzikiza obusaale bwonna obw’omuliro obulasibwa omubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Obulokozi bubafuukire enkuufiira gye mwambadde, n’ekigambo kya Katonda kibabeerere ekitala eky’Omwoyo, <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>nga musabiririranga mu ssaala zonna nga mwegayiririranga mu mwoyo buli kiseera. Mwekuumenga nga mugumiikirizanga, era nga mwegayiririranga abatukuvu, be bantu bonna aba Katonda.<verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Era nange munsabirenga bwe nnaabanga njogera mpeebwe eby’okwogera, era mbyogerenga n’obuvumu nga ntegeeza abantu ekyama ky’Enjiri. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Ndi mubaka wa Njiri ali mu njegere. Munsabire ndyoke ngibuulire abantu n’obuvumu nga bwe kinsaanira.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Tukiko, owooluganda omwagalwa era omuweereza omwesigwa mu Mukama waffe, alibategeeza byonna mulyoke mutegeere ebinfaako ne bye nkola. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Mmutumye gye muli, mulyoke mumanye nga bwe tuli era abagumye emitima gyammwe.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Emirembe n’okwagala awamu n’okukkiriza ebiva eri Katonda Kitaffe ne Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, bibeerenga n’abooluganda.<verse eid="EPH 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Ekisa kya Katonda kibeerenga n’abo bonna abaagala Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo n’okwagala okutaggwaawo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
